{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10274060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10274060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1027406001:1":{"text":"후... 잘됐어, 예상대로 지혜를 시험하는 기믹 제단은 제물을 삼켜버리지 않네.","source_cn":"呼……太好了，如我所料，这种考验智慧的机关祭坛通常不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9BAE6ED1A48F86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027406002:1":{"text":"확실히 비싼 보석처럼 보이네...\n하지만 그걸 꺼내서 기믹을 해제할 수 있다니, 좀 의심스러운데?","source_cn":"的确，这宝石看起来就非常值钱……\\n但你居然能把它拿出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05E253226351D314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027406003:1":{"text":"내가 제단의 본질을 잘 알기 때문에 이런 위험도 무릅쓸 수 있는 거라고, 토끼 귀 오빠!","source_cn":"因为我足够渊博，知道祭坛的本质，才敢于冒险，兔耳朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D45D26AD14C7CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027406004:1":{"text":"이번에는 네게 도발당해서 말려들지 않을 거야. 욕심꾸러기 트레져 헌터!","source_cn":"这次我可不会被你激怒，然后就被带偏话头了，贪婪的宝藏猎人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA2F3C01C0428079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027406005:1":{"text":"당신은 방금 보석을 돌려받은 걸 확인하고서야 안도의 한숨을 내쉬었어.","source_cn":"你明明是直到刚才确认收回了宝石，才终于松了口气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3E1F4958DC0B6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027406006:1":{"text":"그전까지 보석이 제물로 바쳐질 가능성을 알면서도 기꺼이 보석을 잃는 위험을 감수했지...","source_cn":"在此之前，你都是明知宝石被作为祭品牺牲掉的可能性，却甘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7115C6279CD4F162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027406007:1":{"text":"그래서 그게 뭐?\n앞서 말했듯이 보물이 있다면 기여도에 따라 나눠야 해.","source_cn":"所以，这说明什么？\\n我前面也说过了，如果有宝藏，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1FE2C7AB76E9EF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027406008:1":{"text":"나눌지 안 나눌지는 모르겠지만, 한 가지는 알겠네...","source_cn":"分不分成我不确定，但我至少可以猜出一件事——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E02C2607001DEC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027406009:1":{"text":"네가 보물에서 얻고자 하는 건 이 아름답고 값비싼 보석보다 훨씬 더 가치 있다는 거야.","source_cn":"你想从宝藏中得到的东西，价值绝对高于这块美丽而昂贵的宝石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA193BA190A59DF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1027406009":{"text":"네가 보물에서 얻고자 하는 건 이 아름답고 값비싼 보석보다 훨씬 더 가치 있다는 거야.","source_cn":"你想从宝藏中得到的东西，价值绝对高于这块美丽而昂贵的宝石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA193BA190A59DF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027406010:1":{"text":"후훗, 다 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님에게 보고 배운 거예요.","source_cn":"毕竟近朱者赤嘛，<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AC97CC062EC752F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"후훗, 다 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님에게 보고 배운 거예요.","female":"후훗, 다 <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님에게 보고 배운 거예요.","variant_male_record_index":"108040","variant_female_record_index":"108041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027406011:1":{"text":"그러니 대답해 봐, 이 욕심많고 불경스러운 트레져 헌터.\n사슴 영혼의 보물에서 얻으려는 게 대체 뭐야?","source_cn":"所以，回答我吧，贪婪而不敬的宝藏猎人。\\n你到底想从鹿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFAD5A88BB603A98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027406012:1":{"text":"...하하하하!","source_cn":"……哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00B5144EACEBF3C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027406013:1":{"text":"내가 뭘 원하는지도 모르고 계속 그렇게 주절댄 거야?","source_cn":"你滔滔不绝了半天，连我想要什么都不知道吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09234F415D9C281B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027406014:1":{"text":"경건한 너는 탐욕스러운 나보다 아는 게 별로 없구나?","source_cn":"虔诚的你，反而还不如我这个贪婪而不敬的人知道得多哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EF7CC01CEA8DC20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1027406015:1":{"text":"너, 너... 너...!","source_cn":"你、你这个，你这个——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FA65542DB2017BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1027406016:1":{"text":"좋아, 시간도 많이 낭비했으니 말싸움은 그만하자.","source_cn":"好啦，我们已经浪费不少时间了，口舌之争就到此为止吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36B97E60E03F73DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027406017:1":{"text":"다음 수수께끼 앞에서는 이제 기다리지 않을 거야. 선착순이다!","source_cn":"下个解谜我可不会再等了，先到者得！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x505B36C4D5A0D09A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1027406018:0":{"text":"먼저 갈게, 안녕!","source_cn":"先走一步，回见！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1FD6665E5729CAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1027406019:0":{"text":"야, 야! 거기 서!","source_cn":"喂！喂！你给我站住！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C0FED00DE2E2B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"로잔이 똑똑해졌어!","source_cn":"洛桑，你变聪明了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2217ED87EED89397","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"로잔이 똑똑해졌어!","female":"로잔이 똑똑해졌어!","variant_male_record_index":"60828","variant_female_record_index":"60829","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿塔兰忒":{"text":"아탈란테","source":"阿塔兰忒","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":22,"localized_text_count":21,"speaker_count":2}}